ps (manufacturing and process machines, S14). See &amp;quot;EU scope (idea C1)&amp;quot;.&lt;br&gt;Not needed: Plan OPT ShiftStartTime, Defect Parts, Target, OEE (no page uses them); a raw shift column (the Hull colour is already in ShiftName); a Shift Naming table." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;fontSize=11;arcSize=8;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1164" width="1290" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="Current map: overview" id="site1"><mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="0" pageScale="1" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="d1c2" value="&lt;b&gt;Current map: sources, where they are built, the tables Tableau reads and the pages that use them&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:9px&quot; color=&quot;#555555&quot;&gt;Tables in eu_report/report/&amp;lt;table&amp;gt;/ hold Provideam and SIH rows side by side (Data Source); a line switches with reportSource in Config. New tables and In EU Report are proposals, nothing built.&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="20" width="1300" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="d1c3" value="&lt;b&gt;OURS TODAY&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;fontSize=11;arcSize=8;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1700" y="20" width="260" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="d1c4" value="&lt;b&gt;OURS + EU SCOPE COLUMN (IDEA C1)&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;fontSize=11;arcSize=8;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1